flowchart LR
  source[C source] --> pp[pp.c macro and include state]
  pp --> lex[lex.c token stream]
  lex --> parse[parser.c AST]
  parse --> sema[sema.c typed scopes]
  sema --> ir[ir.c CFG IR]
  ir --> verify[ir_verify.c]
  verify --> ssa[ssa.c scalar promotion]
  ssa --> opt[opt_pipeline.c verified pass contracts]
  opt --> cfg[CFG, sparse constants and value numbering]
  cfg --> values[Strength reduction and copy cleanup]
  values --> memory[Local memory elimination]
  memory --> loops[Natural-loop motion and dead code]
  loops --> edge[mir.c critical-edge splitting]
  edge --> selected[mir_select.c owned target forms and banks]
  selected --> alloc[regalloc.c intervals and clobber restrictions]
  alloc --> x86[x86_64.c selected bytes and target pseudos]
  x86 --> elf[elf64.c ELF64 relocatable]
  ir --> interp[ir_interp.c independent evaluator]
  lex --> inspect[inspect.c local report]
